{
  "name": "01 · Contact Form → Email (owner alert + customer auto-reply)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Contact us",
        "formDescription": "Send us a message and we'll get back to you shortly.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Name",
              "placeholder": "Jane Smith",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "placeholder": "jane@example.com",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Phone",
              "placeholder": "Optional"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "How can we help?",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "respondWithOptions": {
            "values": {
              "respondWith": "text",
              "formSubmittedText": "Thanks! Your message is on its way. We'll reply within 1 business day."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "4d9b7dac-ff3d-5c3d-a44a-4dfac4d2100c",
      "name": "Contact Form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "f3a3f3d0-35e1-59c3-af04-83480256a6ca"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "20ced8ca-3b4e-5b7e-9d8c-0460b6c741aa",
              "name": "businessName",
              "value": "Your Business Name",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "6aec1965-5179-554c-8a89-365b78ba71a3",
              "name": "ownerEmail",
              "value": "you@yourbusiness.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "dd58906c-2592-52a8-9bec-c2557f71fae9",
              "name": "fromEmail",
              "value": "hello@yourbusiness.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1846d741-501b-5b2f-98b1-efaad9051d51",
              "name": "replyTime",
              "value": "1 business day",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "562d23f6-de41-524c-baca-d27b2424b66c",
              "name": "brandColor",
              "value": "#2563eb",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cf7133ca-0c7d-573e-b3f6-11b57e45aa29",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Edit these values for your business.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Config').first().json.fromEmail }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Config').first().json.ownerEmail }}",
        "subject": "=New inquiry from {{ $('Contact Form').item.json.Name }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2937;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px\"><h2 style=\"margin-top:0\">New website inquiry</h2><p><b>Name:</b> {{ $('Contact Form').item.json.Name }}<br><b>Email:</b> {{ $('Contact Form').item.json.Email }}<br><b>Phone:</b> {{ $('Contact Form').item.json.Phone || '—' }}<br><b>Received:</b> {{ $('Contact Form').item.json.submittedAt }}</p><p><b>Message:</b><br>{{ ($('Contact Form').item.json['How can we help?'] || '').replace(/\\n/g, '<br>') }}</p><p style=\"color:#6b7280\">Just hit Reply to answer them directly.</p><p style=\"margin-top:32px;color:#6b7280;font-size:13px\">{{ $('Config').first().json.businessName }}</p></div>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "replyTo": "={{ $('Contact Form').item.json.Email }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "905a1e1a-ce06-5086-a4ee-4dfd380f1903",
      "name": "Email Owner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL",
          "name": "SMTP account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Config').first().json.fromEmail }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Contact Form').item.json.Email }}",
        "subject": "=Thanks for contacting {{ $('Config').first().json.businessName }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2937;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px\"><p>Hi {{ $('Contact Form').item.json.Name.split(' ')[0] }},</p><p>Thanks for getting in touch! We've received your message and a real person will reply within {{ $('Config').first().json.replyTime }}.</p><p style=\"border-left:3px solid #e5e7eb;padding-left:12px;color:#4b5563\">{{ ($('Contact Form').item.json['How can we help?'] || '').replace(/\\n/g, '<br>') }}</p><p>Talk soon,</p><p style=\"margin-top:32px;color:#6b7280;font-size:13px\">{{ $('Config').first().json.businessName }}</p></div>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "replyTo": "={{ $('Config').first().json.ownerEmail }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "7c252855-561e-570d-9561-4937723b5b7b",
      "name": "Auto-Reply to Customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL",
          "name": "SMTP account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Contact Form → Email\nA hosted contact form that emails you every inquiry and sends the customer an instant, friendly auto-reply.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open the **Config** node and fill in your business name, your email, the address emails are sent from, and your usual reply time.\n2. Open **Email Owner** and pick (or create) your **SMTP** credential. Do the same on **Auto-Reply to Customer**.\n3. Optional: open **Contact Form** to change the title, fields or the thank-you message.\n4. Click **Activate**. Open the **Contact Form** node and copy the **Production URL** — that's your form link.\n5. Put the link on your website (button, menu item or `<iframe>`), Google Business Profile, Instagram bio, etc.\n\nFull guide: README.md in this workflow's folder.",
        "height": 438,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ac16371f-ceee-5675-82b7-8a1629698999",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        220
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Contact Form": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email Owner",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Email Owner": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Auto-Reply to Customer",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true
  },
